{"logId": "915f6454-cc57-41bd-a50f-f822c59179a3", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "“经营商品”与“经营人品”\n读《东来致顾客的一封信》随想之五", "block_bbox": [277, 263, 679, 330], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[277.0, 263.0], [679.0, 263.0], [679.0, 330.0], [277.0, 330.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "于东来有句名言：“经商，不只是经营商品，更要经营人品。”", "block_bbox": [277, 367, 810, 394], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[277.0, 367.0], [810.0, 367.0], [810.0, 394.0], [277.0, 394.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "这话讲得很深刻。经商要“经营商品”，无人不晓，但经商“更要经营人品”。而这，正是胖东来人在竞争激烈的商战中，之所以能站得高些，想得深些，看得远些的一个重要原因，也是一种意义深远的人本力量。", "block_bbox": [237, 406, 1017, 510], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[237.0, 406.0], [1017.0, 406.0], [1017.0, 510.0], [237.0, 510.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "我理解胖东来人的“人品经营”，主要是注重三个方面的教育：", "block_bbox": [277, 521, 815, 548], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[277.0, 521.0], [815.0, 521.0], [815.0, 548.0], [277.0, 548.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [72, 599, 226, 728], "block_id": 4, "block_order": null, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[72.0, 599.0], [226.0, 599.0], [226.0, 728.0], [72.0, 728.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "一是教育员工懂得，要经好商，必须先做好人——“做一个实实在在的人，做一个对社会有用的人。”胖东来企业为什么重视抓“做人”？因为万事以人为本。一个企业把全体员工都培养成为优秀的人，就拥了人间最宝贵的财富。\n二是教育引导员工把优秀的人品化作为顾客提供全面质量管理服务的实际行动。因为经营商品，不单是员工与顾客物与钱的交换，而且还充满心与心的交流，情与情的沟通。为此，胖东来企业要求员工把优秀的人品融入商品经营之中，营造和谐，制造快乐，让商场成为顾客“家园。”\n三是打造企业精神，组建同心同德的优秀团队。一个万人大的企业，如果没有强大的精神支柱，将会缺失动力。为此，该集团把长期形成的企业文化，浓缩为“四心”的企业精神，即“真心为顾客，诚心待员工，爱心献社会，信心求发展”。", "block_bbox": [237, 560, 1017, 663], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[237.0, 560.0], [1017.0, 560.0], [1017.0, 663.0], [237.0, 663.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [589, 673, 1019, 932], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[589.0, 673.0], [1019.0, 673.0], [1019.0, 932.0], [589.0, 932.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [650, 943, 1017, 1163], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[650.0, 943.0], [1017.0, 943.0], [1017.0, 1163.0], [650.0, 1163.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [223, 718, 618, 1155], "block_id": 8, "block_order": null, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[223.0, 718.0], [618.0, 718.0], [618.0, 1155.0], [223.0, 1155.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "展。”可以想象，用这“四心”凝结员工的心，会产生多么巨大的精神力量啊！", "block_bbox": [237, 1172, 913, 1201], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[237.0, 1172.0], [913.0, 1172.0], [913.0, 1201.0], [237.0, 1201.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "无声的爱", "block_bbox": [110, 1406, 263, 1449], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[110.0, 1406.0], [263.0, 1406.0], [263.0, 1449.0], [110.0, 1449.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.5702150464057922, "coordinate": [277, 263, 679, 330], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[277.0, 263.0], [679.0, 263.0], [679.0, 330.0], [277.0, 330.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8116778135299683, "coordinate": [277, 367, 810, 394], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[277.0, 367.0], [810.0, 367.0], [810.0, 394.0], [277.0, 394.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9275057911872864, "coordinate": [237, 406, 1017, 510], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[237.0, 406.0], [1017.0, 406.0], [1017.0, 510.0], [237.0, 510.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8194570541381836, "coordinate": [277, 521, 815, 548], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[277.0, 521.0], [815.0, 521.0], [815.0, 548.0], [277.0, 548.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.6511766910552979, "coordinate": [72, 599, 226, 728], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[72.0, 599.0], [226.0, 599.0], [226.0, 728.0], [72.0, 728.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9317114353179932, "coordinate": [237, 560, 1017, 663], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[237.0, 560.0], [1017.0, 560.0], [1017.0, 663.0], [237.0, 663.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9173147082328796, "coordinate": [223, 718, 618, 1155], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[223.0, 718.0], [618.0, 718.0], [618.0, 1155.0], [223.0, 1155.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8814948201179504, "coordinate": [589, 673, 1019, 932], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[589.0, 673.0], [1019.0, 673.0], [1019.0, 932.0], [589.0, 932.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9320230484008789, "coordinate": [650, 943, 1017, 1163], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[650.0, 943.0], [1017.0, 943.0], [1017.0, 1163.0], [650.0, 1163.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.4088970124721527, "coordinate": [237, 1172, 913, 1201], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[237.0, 1172.0], [913.0, 1172.0], [913.0, 1201.0], [237.0, 1201.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.632355809211731, "coordinate": [110, 1406, 263, 1449], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[110.0, 1406.0], [263.0, 1406.0], [263.0, 1449.0], [110.0, 1449.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## “经营商品”与“经营人品” 读《东来致顾客的一封信》随想之五\n\n于东来有句名言：“经商，不只是经营商品，更要经营人品。”\n\n这话讲得很深刻。经商要“经营商品”，无人不晓，但经商“更要经营人品”。而这，正是胖东来人在竞争激烈的商战中，之所以能站得高些，想得深些，看得远些的一个重要原因，也是一种意义深远的人本力量。\n\n我理解胖东来人的“人品经营”，主要是注重三个方面的教育：\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_72_599_226_728.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"12%\" /></div>\n\n\n一是教育员工懂得，要经好商，必须先做好人——“做一个实实在在的人，做一个对社会有用的人。”胖东来企业为什么重视抓“做人”？因为万事以人为本。一个企业把全体员工都培养成为优秀的人，就拥了人间最宝贵的财富。\n\n二是教育引导员工把优秀的人品化作为顾客提供全面质量管理服务的实际行动。因为经营商品，不单是员工与顾客物与钱的交换，而且还充满心与心的交流，情与情的沟通。为此，胖东来企业要求员工把优秀的人品融入商品经营之中，营造和谐，制造快乐，让商场成为顾客“家园。”\n\n三是打造企业精神，组建同心同德的优秀团队。一个万人大的企业，如果没有强大的精神支柱，将会缺失动力。为此，该集团把长期形成的企业文化，浓缩为“四心”的企业精神，即“真心为顾客，诚心待员工，爱心献社会，信心求发展”。\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_223_718_618_1155.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"33%\" /></div>\n\n\n展。”可以想象，用这“四心”凝结员工的心，会产生多么巨大的精神力量啊！\n\n## 无声的爱", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_72_599_226_728.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//915f6454-cc57-41bd-a50f-f822c59179a3/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_72_599_226_728.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A35%3A19Z%2F-1%2F%2Feb7ab9f84798867e894cb4736572a9149f01b95da8ce5deb0ef9ba976608ec8b", "imgs/img_in_image_box_223_718_618_1155.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//915f6454-cc57-41bd-a50f-f822c59179a3/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_223_718_618_1155.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A35%3A19Z%2F-1%2F%2Fcff38e21da822e30cec120ac1261930833beb2c2b4d237154f7e8d4c6b7942d1"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//915f6454-cc57-41bd-a50f-f822c59179a3/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A35%3A19Z%2F-1%2F%2Fa8499e862a7c6a4b7016abc18809c793809b3178458a35c48fcea97310ce922a"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//915f6454-cc57-41bd-a50f-f822c59179a3/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2